<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f97316" />
  <title>Bodywork — Autobody Estimate &amp; Invoice Software</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/styles.css" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/public/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <style>
    body { padding-bottom: 0; }

    .land-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      z-index: 100;
    }
    .land-logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .land-logo .logo-icon { color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.5rem; }

    .land-hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .land-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .land-hero h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
    .land-hero p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .land-cta-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .land-features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto 5rem;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
    .land-feature {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .land-feature-icon {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      display: block;
    }
    .land-feature h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
    .land-feature p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .land-pricing {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 5rem;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
    .land-pricing h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .pricing-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 540px) {
      .pricing-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .pricing-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .pricing-card.featured {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      position: relative;
    }
    .pricing-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: -0.75rem;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 99px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .pricing-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .pricing-price {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
    .pricing-price span {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .pricing-desc {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .pricing-features {
      list-style: none;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }
    .pricing-features li {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      padding: 0.35rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface-2);
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .pricing-features li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .check { color: var(--success); flex-shrink: 0; }
    .cross { color: var(--text-muted); flex-shrink: 0; }

    .land-footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="land-nav">
  <a href="/" class="land-logo">
    <span class="logo-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9881;</span>
    Bodywork
  </a>
  <a href="/login" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Sign In</a>
</nav>

<section class="land-hero">
  <h1>Estimates &amp; invoices built for <span>auto body shops</span></h1>
  <p>Write professional estimates, convert them to invoices, and share them with customers — all from one simple app designed for the shop floor.</p>
  <div class="land-cta-group">
    <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started Free</a>
    <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-ghost">See Pricing</a>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="land-features">
  <div class="land-feature">
    <span class="land-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128203;</span>
    <h3>Fast Estimates</h3>
    <p>Line items for labor, parts, paint, and sublet. Totals and tax calculated automatically.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="land-feature">
    <span class="land-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128196;</span>
    <h3>One-Click Invoicing</h3>
    <p>Convert an approved estimate into an invoice in seconds — no re-entering data.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="land-feature">
    <span class="land-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128279;</span>
    <h3>Shareable Links</h3>
    <p>Send customers a read-only link to their estimate or invoice. No login required on their end.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="land-feature">
    <span class="land-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128241;</span>
    <h3>Mobile-First</h3>
    <p>Works great on your phone in the shop. Installable as a PWA for quick access.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="land-pricing" id="pricing">
  <h2>Simple pricing</h2>
  <div class="pricing-cards">
    <div class="pricing-card">
      <h3>Free</h3>
      <div class="pricing-price">$0 <span>/ mo</span></div>
      <p class="pricing-desc">Perfect for getting started.</p>
      <ul class="pricing-features">
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> 3 estimates / month</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Customer management</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Shareable estimate links</li>
        <li><span class="cross">&#215;</span> Invoicing</li>
        <li><span class="cross">&#215;</span> Unlimited estimates</li>
        <li><span class="cross">&#215;</span> Client history</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/login" class="btn btn-ghost" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;">Start Free</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-card featured">
      <span class="pricing-badge">Most Popular</span>
      <h3>Pro</h3>
      <div class="pricing-price">$29 <span>/ mo</span></div>
      <p class="pricing-desc">Everything you need to run your shop.</p>
      <ul class="pricing-features">
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Unlimited estimates</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Customer management</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Shareable links</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Full invoicing</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Client history &amp; search</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Custom shop branding</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/upgrade" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;">Upgrade to Pro</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="land-footer">
  &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Bodywork. Built for the shop floor.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
